<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Tri-Eye targeting array -->
  <DNX_TriEyeTargetingArray.label>三眼瞄准阵列</DNX_TriEyeTargetingArray.label>
  <!-- EN: A larger fire-control marking array that locks up to three hostile targets at once, reveals invisible enemies, exposes weakpoints, and increases their chance to be hit. It is especially useful when building layered defensive positions. -->
  <DNX_TriEyeTargetingArray.description>一种更大型的火控标记阵列，可同时锁定最多三个敌对目标、揭示隐形敌人、暴露弱点，并提高其被命中的概率。在构建层次化防御阵地时尤其有用。</DNX_TriEyeTargetingArray.description>
  
  <!-- EN: Boxer 35mm twin anti-aircraft turret -->
  <DNX_Turret_Boxer35mmAA.label>“拳击手”35mm双联防空炮塔</DNX_Turret_Boxer35mmAA.label>
  <!-- EN: A heavy twin 35mm anti-aircraft turret that fires high-velocity armor-piercing shells and can intercept incoming explosive projectiles. <color=yellow>The 35mm AA turret can fire programmed ammunition at very long range to shoot down hostile drones and projectiles, but interception is not guaranteed. Build multiple turrets if you want a higher success rate.</color> -->
  <DNX_Turret_Boxer35mmAA.description>一座重型双联35mm防空炮塔，可发射高速穿甲弹，并能拦截来袭爆炸射弹。&lt;color=yellow&gt;35mmAA能够在很远距离发射编程弹药，击落敌人的无人机、炮弹，但是这不是100%成功的。如果想要提高成功率，需要建设多个。&lt;/color&gt;</DNX_Turret_Boxer35mmAA.description>
  <!-- EN: 35mm ammunition -->
  <DNX_Turret_Boxer35mmAA.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>35mm弹药</DNX_Turret_Boxer35mmAA.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
  <!-- EN: 35mm ammunition -->
  <DNX_Turret_Boxer35mmAA.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>35mm弹药</DNX_Turret_Boxer35mmAA.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>
  <!-- EN: 35mm ammunition depleted -->
  <DNX_Turret_Boxer35mmAA.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>35mm弹药耗尽</DNX_Turret_Boxer35mmAA.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>
  <!-- EN: 35mm ammunition -->
  <DNX_Turret_Boxer35mmAA.comps.CompPointDefenseInterceptor.refuelableFuelLabel>35mm弹药</DNX_Turret_Boxer35mmAA.comps.CompPointDefenseInterceptor.refuelableFuelLabel>
  
  <!-- EN: Gyrfalcon-M 20mm composite cannon turret -->
  <DNX_Turret_GyrfalconM20mmComposite.label>“灰隼-M”20mm复合机炮炮塔</DNX_Turret_GyrfalconM20mmComposite.label>
  <!-- EN: A heavy twin 20mm Vulcan turret with extreme burst fire and manually launched deep-penetration anti-armor missiles. -->
  <DNX_Turret_GyrfalconM20mmComposite.description>“灰隼-M”是一座面向高级防御阵地设计的重型复合火力平台，两组20毫米火神炮能够在数秒内形成密集弹幕，对步兵集群、轻型载具与低空目标实施毁灭性压制。面对常规机炮难以击穿的重装甲单位时，操作员可手动发射深穿透反装甲导弹，对目标内部结构进行定点破坏；建造高速弹链供给器后，炮塔还可接入多种专用弹药，根据战况切换穿甲、燃烧或其他功能弹种。其庞大的体积、惊人的耗弹量与多层武器配置，常让前线士兵想起古地球某个大国那种被称为“终结者”的重型步战车辆——只不过“灰隼-M”不需要道路，也没有后退挡。\n\n一名老兵第一次见到“灰隼-M”时，围着它走了三圈。\n他最后拍了拍装甲外壳：“古地球人给这类东西装履带，是因为他们还想把它带回去。”\n灰隼的炮管随即开始预转，老兵立刻补充：“当然，留在这里也很好。”</DNX_Turret_GyrfalconM20mmComposite.description>
  <!-- EN: 20mm ammunition -->
  <DNX_Turret_GyrfalconM20mmComposite.comps.CompRefuelable-0.fuelGizmoLabel>20mm弹药</DNX_Turret_GyrfalconM20mmComposite.comps.CompRefuelable-0.fuelGizmoLabel>
