  <!-- EN: M301 "Longbow" rocket artillery -->
  <DNX_Turret_LongbowM301RocketArtillery.label>M301“长弓”火箭炮</DNX_Turret_LongbowM301RocketArtillery.label>
  <!-- EN: A long-range support rocket turret that saturates distant target zones with large unguided arcing rocket barrages. It can switch between high-explosive, armor-piercing, and incendiary rockets. -->
  <DNX_Turret_LongbowM301RocketArtillery.description>一座远程支援火箭炮塔，会用大型无制导抛射火箭弹幕饱和覆盖远处目标区域。它可以在高爆、穿甲和燃烧火箭之间切换。</DNX_Turret_LongbowM301RocketArtillery.description>
  <!-- EN: Longbow rockets -->
  <DNX_Turret_LongbowM301RocketArtillery.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>长弓火箭</DNX_Turret_LongbowM301RocketArtillery.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
  <!-- EN: Longbow rockets -->
  <DNX_Turret_LongbowM301RocketArtillery.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>长弓火箭</DNX_Turret_LongbowM301RocketArtillery.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>
  <!-- EN: Longbow rockets depleted -->
