  <!-- EN: MLS-16 Opener missile turret -->
  <DNX_Turret_OpenerMLSSixteen.label>MLS-16“开幕者”导弹炮塔</DNX_Turret_OpenerMLSSixteen.label>
  <!-- EN: A heavy multi-launch missile turret that marks targets during warmup before firing armor-piercing missiles. -->
  <DNX_Turret_OpenerMLSSixteen.description>MLS-16“开幕者”是一座重型多联装导弹炮塔，需要经过短暂的锁定、威胁评估与弹道规划后，才能向目标连续发射导弹。其高级目标分配系统会根据敌人数量、威胁等级与预计毁伤效果自动规划弹药：面对集群时，它能够将导弹合理分配至多个目标；面对重型单位或关键敌人时，也可集中全部火力实施饱和打击。</DNX_Turret_OpenerMLSSixteen.description>
  <!-- EN: MLS-16 missiles -->
  <DNX_Turret_OpenerMLSSixteen.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>MLS-16导弹</DNX_Turret_OpenerMLSSixteen.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
  <!-- EN: MLS-16 missiles -->
  <DNX_Turret_OpenerMLSSixteen.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>MLS-16导弹</DNX_Turret_OpenerMLSSixteen.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>
  <!-- EN: MLS-16 missiles depleted -->
  <DNX_Turret_OpenerMLSSixteen.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>MLS-16 导弹已耗尽</DNX_Turret_OpenerMLSSixteen.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>
  
  <!-- EN: Orchestra 40mm chain cannon turret -->
  <DNX_Turret_Orchestra40mmChainCannon.label>管弦乐 40mm链炮炮塔</DNX_Turret_Orchestra40mmChainCannon.label>
  <!-- EN: An experimental 40mm chain cannon turret with short, high-impact burst fire. -->
  <DNX_Turret_Orchestra40mmChainCannon.description>一座实验性40mm链炮炮塔，具备短促、高冲击力的爆发射击能力。</DNX_Turret_Orchestra40mmChainCannon.description>
